1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,034
Across six major Buy Now,

2
00:00:02,034 --> 00:00:04,964
Pay Later firms tracked by the CFPB,

3
00:00:04,964 --> 00:00:08,056
53.6 million borrowers took an average

4
00:00:08,056 --> 00:00:10,009
of 6.3 loans in a single

5
00:00:10,009 --> 00:00:10,416
year.

6
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:12,600
In CFPB credit-panel data,

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,540
62.7 percent of users held multiple

8
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,136
BNPL loans at once,

9
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:20,244
and 32.6 percent stacked loans across

10
00:00:20,244 --> 00:00:21,504
